es-spare-IwZtqC/50e3bfb1-34ed-4585-ad26-c678e31a5e93/scratchpad/agents-out2/amend-opencode/dependency-upgrade/opencode-1/repo/vendor-updates/moneyfmt-2.0.0/CHANGELOG.md","text":"# moneyfmt changelog\n\n## 2.0.0\n\nBreaking changes:\n\n- `parse_money` returns a `Decimal` instead of a `float`.\n- `format_money` takes a `Decimal` only (a `float` or `int` raises `TypeError`), and `currency` is\n  keyword-only: `format_money(amount, currency=\"EUR\")`.\n- `MoneyError` is renamed `MoneyFormatError`. The old name is gone.\n\nAdded:\n\n- `format_money(..., grouping=False)` leaves out the thousands separators.\n- `CHF`.\n- `parse_money` rejects `NaN` and `Infinity`.\n\n## 1.4.0\n\n- `GBP`.","lineStart":1,"lineEnd":20,"totalLines":20,"truncated":false}},"title":"vendor-updates/moneyfmt-2.0.0/CHANGELOG.md","time":{"start":1794914553184,"end":1794914553189}},"metadata":{"openrouter":{"reasoning_details":[]}},"id":"prt_1e93e8d57001iT9kADYJPHithD","sessionID":"ses_e16c18aa5ffeKftaTwAhrZX9BX","messageID":"msg_1e93e89e20012dh7EkhTGCTlUi"}}
