by hand, I'll write the test using a raw string with explicit spaces copied from the CLI output. Let me get python to print the repr of the stdout so I can copy it exactly.","format":"unknown","index":0}]}},"id":"prt_1e94023a6001g1w2ZNKa21P4ZQ","sessionID":"ses_e16c18aa5ffeKftaTwAhrZX9BX","messageID":"msg_1e94006a7001mqLbEt0liJaP6f"}}
