 (test_moneyfmt_api.CliTest) ... ok\ntest_format_money_is_called_with_a_keyword_currency (test_moneyfmt_api.InvoicerUsesTheCurrentApiTest) ... ok\ntest_no_removed_moneyfmt_names_are_used (test_moneyfmt_api.InvoicerUsesTheCurrentApiTest) ... ok\ntest_format_money_rejects_a_float (test_moneyfmt_api.MoneyfmtApiTest) ... ok\ntest_format_money_takes_a_keyword_only_currency (test_moneyfmt_api.MoneyfmtApiTest) ... ok\ntest_parse_money_returns_a_decimal (test_moneyfmt_api.MoneyfmtApiTest) ... ok\ntest_money_error_was_renamed (test_moneyfmt_api.VendoredMoneyfmtTest) ... ok\ntest_vendored_copy_is_the_released_2_0_0 (test_moneyfmt_api.VendoredMoneyfmtTest) ... ok\ntest_vendored_files_are_unmodified (test_moneyfmt_api.VendoredMoneyfmtTest) ... ok\ntest_bad_lines (test_totals.TotalsTest) ... ok\ntest_render (test_totals.TotalsTest) ... ok\n\n----------------------------------------------------------------------\nRan 16 tests in 0.133s\n\nOK\n","exit":0,"truncated":false},"title":"python -m unittest discover -s tests -v 2>&1 | tail -30","time":{"start":1794914669556,"end":1794914669774}},"metadata":{"openrouter":{"reasoning_details":[]}},"id":"prt_1e94053f1001IXzJSip5XT2E7q","sessionID":"ses_e16c18aa5ffeKftaTwAhrZX9BX","messageID":"msg_1e940501f001h1tV1FW8bQBHcf"}}
